good overview of the situation for female graduate students and
faculty.

[Tidwell 1990] Tidwell, Jenifer.  "Hackers in the Garden: A Case Study
of Women in Computer Engineering", unpublished, 1990. A report on how
the environment in the MIT Media Lab, while not intentionally sexist,
was less hospitable to women.
