kadie@eff.org (Carl M. Kadie) writes:

]Be that as it may, it is the policy of the University of Illinois.

]Here is the University's definition of sexual harassment, followed by
]the procedure. Both are excerpted from the University of Illinois at
]Urbana-Champaign Code on Campus Affairs and Handbook of Policies and
